{"id":"3dd0e6836d447ca6","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-partial-function.md","title":"Partial Function","display":"df-partial-function — Partial Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-partial-function","aliases":["58-df-partial-function","58-df-zfc-fun-partial-function","58-df-zfc-map-partial-function"],"display":"df-partial-function — Partial Function","depends_on":["[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-partial-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-partial-function</span><span>58-df-zfc-fun-partial-function</span><span>58-df-zfc-map-partial-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-partial-function — Partial Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"58-df-set\">58-df-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> (binary relation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> (sets)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (total-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialFunction}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialFunction}\\)</span> (defined here; partial-function predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFunPartialFunction}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcMapPartialFunction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFunPartialFunction}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcMapPartialFunction}_S\\)</span> (alias predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial-function} \\vdash \\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,A,B)\\leftrightarrow\\exists D\\in V\\;(D\\subseteq A\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,D,B))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial-function} \\vdash \\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,A,B)\\leftrightarrow\\exists D\\in V\\;(D\\subseteq A\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,D,B))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc-fun-partial-function-alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFunPartialFunction}_S(f,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,X,Y)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc-fun-partial-function-alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFunPartialFunction}_S(f,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,X,Y)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc-map-partial-function-alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMapPartialFunction}_S(f,A,B)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcFunPartialFunction}_S(f,A,B)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc-map-partial-function-alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMapPartialFunction}_S(f,A,B)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcFunPartialFunction}_S(f,A,B)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>部分函数与（全）函数的区别：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>函数</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(f, A, B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(f, A, B)\\)</span>：对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x \\in A\">\\(x \\in A\\)</span>，存在唯一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y \\in B\">\\(y \\in B\\)</span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(x, y) \\in f\">\\((x, y) \\in f\\)</span></li>\n<li><strong>部分函数</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f, A, B)\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f, A, B)\\)</span>：存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C \\subseteq A\">\\(C \\subseteq A\\)</span>，使得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 上的（全）函数</li>\n</ul>\n<p>两种定义等价：第一种更优雅，展示了&quot;部分&quot;的本质；第二种更具体，便于直接使用。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-fun-partial-function</code> and <code>58-df-zfc-map-partial-function</code> are merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (total-function predicate, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"A,B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartialFunction}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFunPartialFunction}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcMapPartialFunction}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial-function} \\vdash \\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,A,B)\\leftrightarrow\\exists D\\in V\\;(D\\subseteq A\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,D,B))","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc-fun-partial-function-alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFunPartialFunction}_S(f,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,X,Y)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc-map-partial-function-alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMapPartialFunction}_S(f,A,B)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcFunPartialFunction}_S(f,A,B)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(f, A, B)","display":false},{"tex":"x \\in A","display":false},{"tex":"y \\in B","display":false},{"tex":"(x, y) \\in f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f, A, B)","display":false},{"tex":"C \\subseteq A","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false}],"bytes":1646,"backlinks":[{"id":"457d2f1becb8a815","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"278f83d281480a6e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c5767a17f6208a12","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"da0bcf2e3f060472","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a7e1b630ead60caa","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{PartialFunction}$ 取 [[../batch16/58-df-partial-function.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"6af7fe1bc2b3f480","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartialFunction}$ (partial-function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-partial-function.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-940","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-partial-function.md|58-df-partial-function]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751","65d9a1e690c32aad"]}